%%body
{
  While your body does not care for rest, your mind appreciates it, however the excitement of turning Compressed Scrap into Abyssal Iron had caused you miss the time.

  A tingle hits your spine and you dodge a spear within a hair's breadth.

    @ Nori "Yeesh, not that KAVINU again!"

  You weren't particularly enamoured by its presence, but you vaguely understand how and why it appeared.

    @ Nori "Oh, you have an idea of why?"

  Eyeing the Kavinu's unsteady movements, it eyed you, not with anger, but anguish, exhaustion even.

  Fighting it off as best as you could, it backs off for now and you decide to conclude the experiment for the time being and take a rest.

  After a good night's rest, even you had to agree, you felt refreshed.

    @ Nori "While you rested, I did look into the KAVINU some more, it appears they are directly tied to your mental condition, lack of rest increases the likelihood of them appearing..."

  Routine rest it is then.

    @ Nori "Agreed, it is impossible to defeat them as we are now..."

  You wished Nori would rest, but you suppose being a "Zaonith", whatever that was, meant he was always working.

    @ Nori "You thought something rather rude."

  Rolling your eyes, you start the new day.

}
%date 2025-12-26
